					"id": 700501503,
					"content": "先把她扶起來吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501504
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501504,
					"content": "把吉雅羅扶起來，讓她好好坐在地上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501505,
					"content": "原來是這種感覺…還真是夠痛苦的，不僅身體很疲憊，就連思考也變遲鈍了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "吉雅羅"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501506,
					"content": "這樣算是取材成功了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501507,
					"content": "當然，取材非常成功。我終於弄清被捆起來吊在野外一整晚，究竟是怎樣的一種感覺了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "吉雅羅"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501508,
					"content": "妳那本小說的主角，真的很有韌性呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501509,
					"content": "沒錯。我也想好了主角趕走那隻「玄文獸」的方法，用這種手法結尾，一定…一定…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "吉雅羅"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501510,
					"content": "喔！有什麼厲害的手法嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501511,
					"content": "一定…不錯…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "吉雅羅"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501512,
					"content": "吉雅羅再次暈倒在了地上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501513
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501513,
					"content": "嗚哇！吉雅羅小姐，妳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501514
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501514,
					"content": "妳把手法說出來再暈倒啊！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501515
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 700501515,
					"content": "總、總而言之，先送她去找醫生…先送回莊裡吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700501516
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 700501516,
					"content": "洪分小姐果然說得沒錯，吉雅羅小姐就不該離開翹英莊啦——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
